6 < 1 ## When it applies
7 < 1 
8 < 1 Greenfield **target apps** only — a codebase the plan itself brings into
9 < 1 existence. It is never a restriction on an existing repo (whose stack is
10 < 1 already chosen and whose suite already runs), never on ultrapowers' own suite
11 < 1 (pytest), and never on the fleet driver (Node — its spawn/SIGTERM semantics are
12 < 1 what the driver measures, so it stays where it is).
